•	Find all CVE-related lines, extract the CVE identifiers, and convert them to lowercase.
grep -Eo 'CVE-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{4,}' security_log.txt | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]'

 
•	Find all entries containing .exe, extract the relevant filename, and convert it to uppercase.
grep -Eo '[[:alnum:]_.-]+\.exe\b' security_log.txt | tr '[:lower:]' '[:upper:]'



